WEBVTT

00:01.605 --> 00:02.942
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.966 --> 00:04.301
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.325 --> 00:07.541
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.565 --> 00:13.125
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.125 --> 01:31.085
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.245 --> 01:34.485
=Episode 18=

01:35.035 --> 01:36.336
(Solitary Central Plains)

01:36.360 --> 01:39.210
(Xiangfan, Qingzhou)

01:39.285 --> 01:40.501
Come and have a look.

01:44.010 --> 01:45.761
(Xiangfan)

01:45.785 --> 01:47.457
Hot steamed stuffed buns.

01:48.110 --> 01:49.411
Hot steamed stuffed buns.

01:49.435 --> 01:50.435
Bamboo ware.

01:51.085 --> 01:52.429
Bamboo ware for sale.

01:54.210 --> 01:54.886
Sir, buy some.

01:54.910 --> 01:55.536
Umbrellas.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.137
Miss.

01:56.161 --> 01:57.402
Durable umbrellas.

01:57.426 --> 01:58.386
Have a look.

01:58.410 --> 02:00.885
(Solitary Central Plains)

02:01.335 --> 02:02.335
Let's go over there.

02:03.585 --> 02:05.211
Good tea.

02:05.235 --> 02:06.860
Delicious rice cake.

02:07.085 --> 02:08.960
Come and have a look.

02:11.610 --> 02:12.386
What's wrong?

02:12.410 --> 02:13.386
Vintage wine.

02:13.410 --> 02:14.410
Nothing.

02:15.360 --> 02:16.386
- The scene evokes your memories?
- Come.

02:16.410 --> 02:17.586
Let's buy some vegetables.

02:17.610 --> 02:19.284
Why can it evoke my memories?

02:19.960 --> 02:21.600
- If I remember correctly,
- See you, sir.

02:21.660 --> 02:24.386
- Xiangfan used to be a big town of Chu.
- Come after you drink it up.

02:24.410 --> 02:25.986
- You were the Princess of Chu.
- What's this?

02:26.010 --> 02:27.386
- Now you're revisiting this town.
- Celery.

02:27.410 --> 02:28.136
It looks good.

02:28.160 --> 02:29.036
You must be touched.

02:29.060 --> 02:29.724
It's indeed good.

02:29.985 --> 02:31.380
- I'm no longer a princess.
- This is good.

02:31.404 --> 02:32.500
Come and have a look.

02:32.524 --> 02:33.660
Broil it with some salt for dinner.

02:33.684 --> 02:35.165
Now, I'm only a maid.

02:36.710 --> 02:37.870
Welcome next time.

02:41.785 --> 02:43.445
I visited this town when I was little.

02:45.085 --> 02:46.804
At that time, people on the street

02:47.404 --> 02:49.360
spoke the accent of Chu.

02:50.710 --> 02:51.925
Not the accent is gone,

02:53.285 --> 02:54.285
but people are gone.

02:58.835 --> 03:01.100
Xu Xiao besieged Xiangfan
for three years

03:01.124 --> 03:02.365
with 100 thousand soldiers.

03:03.185 --> 03:04.945
People of Chu vowed to fight
until they died.

03:05.335 --> 03:07.645
Even civilians guarded
the town spontaneously.

03:09.160 --> 03:10.435
When the town was broken into,

03:11.010 --> 03:12.301
less than ten thousand people

03:12.325 --> 03:13.445
were still alive

03:13.710 --> 03:15.421
when there used to be
200 thousand people in Xiangfan.

03:15.445 --> 03:17.411
Later, people from other towns
migrated to Xiangfan

03:17.435 --> 03:18.804
so that the town prospered again.

03:21.610 --> 03:23.004
Xu Xiao came here after the war.

03:23.660 --> 03:24.660
He said,

03:25.035 --> 03:27.124
hundreds of thousands of ghosts
were buried

03:27.685 --> 03:29.710
behind the bustling streets

03:30.085 --> 03:31.645
and they wailed mournfully every night.

03:34.645 --> 03:35.804
Why did you say this?

03:36.235 --> 03:37.741
To show off your father's invincibility

03:37.765 --> 03:38.885
in attacking cities?

03:43.010 --> 03:44.540
Xu Xiao didn't say that

03:44.564 --> 03:45.605
to show off.

03:45.935 --> 03:47.124
Why did he say that, then?

03:48.660 --> 03:50.941
Actually, there's no such a thing
as a ghost in the world.

03:51.610 --> 03:53.165
The ghosts he talked about

03:53.735 --> 03:55.765
weren't buried in Xiangfan,

03:56.710 --> 03:58.365
but in his heart.

04:02.135 --> 04:04.765
They've been haunting him forever.

04:07.060 --> 04:08.284
Slayer Xu Xiao.

04:09.360 --> 04:11.165
People only know his prestige.

04:11.310 --> 04:12.485
None of them knows

04:12.610 --> 04:14.760
how many ghosts are there in his heart.

04:15.635 --> 04:16.964
Is he regretting it?

04:19.460 --> 04:20.460
No.

04:21.710 --> 04:22.885
He's on guard.

04:23.310 --> 04:24.364
He's reminding himself.

04:25.785 --> 04:27.245
He wants to tell himself

04:27.685 --> 04:29.221
that he must stop the wars
to break out again

04:29.245 --> 04:30.805
at whatever cost.

04:32.410 --> 04:34.284
He wants to protect the peaceful world.

04:35.160 --> 04:36.160
So,

04:36.585 --> 04:39.205
North Liang Army matters most to him.

04:39.535 --> 04:40.535
What about you?

04:44.735 --> 04:45.964
I'm different from him.

04:46.935 --> 04:48.414
I won't be like him.

04:50.285 --> 04:52.685
If I can't even protect
important people around me,

04:53.460 --> 04:54.484
what's the point

04:54.585 --> 04:55.585
of the world

04:55.885 --> 04:57.125
or the big plan?

05:07.060 --> 05:07.936
Come and have a look.

05:07.960 --> 05:08.960
Childish.

05:09.535 --> 05:10.565
You're childish.

05:10.660 --> 05:11.661
You're the most childish.

05:11.685 --> 05:12.861
Who says childish will be childish.

05:12.885 --> 05:14.441
You. Just you!

05:14.465 --> 05:15.236
You're child...

05:15.260 --> 05:16.260
Next,

05:16.385 --> 05:17.385
where are we going?

05:19.285 --> 05:21.500
I know where the henchmen
of our family are hiding.

05:21.524 --> 05:22.621
Let me take you to them.

05:22.645 --> 05:23.645
Don't bother.

05:23.985 --> 05:24.985
Why?

05:25.160 --> 05:26.805
What kind of man is Lord of Jing'an?

05:26.985 --> 05:28.484
I'm afraid

05:28.785 --> 05:30.561
he has cleared away the henchmen
of your family.

05:30.585 --> 05:31.924
What are you going to do then?

05:32.210 --> 05:34.810
Where's the best inn in Xiangfan?

05:36.660 --> 05:37.940
Go straight

05:37.964 --> 05:39.386
and turn right after two intersections.

05:39.410 --> 05:40.410
We're going to the inn.

05:40.560 --> 05:42.400
You're going to the Mansion
of Lord of Jing'an.

05:44.685 --> 05:46.181
Why am I going there?

05:46.205 --> 05:47.205
To take revenge?

05:49.385 --> 05:50.385
To take a message.

05:51.460 --> 05:52.460
What?

05:56.260 --> 06:01.186
(Xiangfan)

06:01.210 --> 06:04.136
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an)

06:04.160 --> 06:06.610
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an, Xiangfan)

06:35.610 --> 06:36.610
Father.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.920
Have you realized
what mistake you made?

06:46.260 --> 06:47.741
I didn't expect

06:47.765 --> 06:49.580
that Xu Fengnian got
so many masters around him.

06:49.604 --> 06:51.085
That's not the point.

06:52.285 --> 06:53.445
Behind him

06:53.985 --> 06:55.325
is North Liang.

06:57.510 --> 06:58.510
Take your seat.

07:17.410 --> 07:18.661
I know killing Xu Fengnian

07:18.685 --> 07:19.925
is like poking a hornets' nest.

07:21.085 --> 07:22.524
But don't worry, Father.

07:22.685 --> 07:24.245
I've arranged the scapegoat.

07:25.460 --> 07:27.005
Even if I failed,

07:27.610 --> 07:29.044
I wouldn't be in trouble.

07:29.685 --> 07:30.735
That's why

07:30.910 --> 07:33.404
you killed Commander Wei's son?

07:33.860 --> 07:35.661
Wei Dong complies in appearance
but opposes in the heart.

07:35.685 --> 07:38.404
He's the spy planted in the navy.

07:40.085 --> 07:42.364
When I killed his son
for Xu Fengnian's case,

07:42.635 --> 07:44.524
we can warn him

07:44.585 --> 07:45.844
and frighten the navy.

07:47.160 --> 07:48.924
I've been telling you

07:49.585 --> 07:51.484
to read more Buddhist scriptures

07:52.085 --> 07:53.565
and cultivate yourself.

07:55.185 --> 07:56.661
Why do you always have

07:56.685 --> 07:57.845
such a strong intent to kill?

07:58.164 --> 07:59.284
I've killed his son already.

08:03.410 --> 08:04.585
The court

08:04.910 --> 08:07.245
always thinks highly

08:07.604 --> 08:08.885
of North Liang.

08:10.785 --> 08:14.005
The legal son of the Lin family
assassinated Xu Fengnian.

08:14.310 --> 08:15.364
How did they end up?

08:16.185 --> 08:18.205
They were exterminated.

08:20.560 --> 08:21.885
You think

08:22.560 --> 08:25.060
the case can be over

08:25.810 --> 08:27.885
when Wei Dong's son is dead?

08:29.335 --> 08:30.645
What do you think I should do?

08:31.435 --> 08:32.341
Wei Dong

08:32.365 --> 08:33.884
has only one son.

08:34.385 --> 08:36.565
He always cares for his son.

08:37.785 --> 08:40.285
His son died before him.

08:40.760 --> 08:42.285
How miserable!

08:43.335 --> 08:44.445
Why not

08:46.060 --> 08:48.244
let them die all together

08:49.185 --> 08:50.635
so that they can

08:51.460 --> 08:53.045
take care of each other in heaven?

08:53.685 --> 08:55.165
You're saying...?

08:55.285 --> 08:57.185
So far,

08:57.710 --> 08:58.950
Wei Dong's family has been dead

08:59.485 --> 09:01.884
with his son.

09:03.085 --> 09:05.604
You've killed all his family?

09:05.785 --> 09:07.124
Only in this way

09:08.235 --> 09:09.525
can we

09:10.160 --> 09:12.124
close the case.

09:13.410 --> 09:14.760
The Wei family is pitiful.

09:15.035 --> 09:16.160
I have

09:16.445 --> 09:17.445
given an order.

09:17.710 --> 09:18.980
Someone

09:19.004 --> 09:19.764
will hold the funeral

09:19.960 --> 09:22.405
for them.

09:22.535 --> 09:24.560
I'm kind of doing a good deed.

09:25.484 --> 09:26.585
So,

09:27.610 --> 09:29.185
I've told you before.

09:30.435 --> 09:31.484
You must

09:31.710 --> 09:33.644
always be merciful.

09:33.810 --> 09:34.581
You,

09:34.605 --> 09:36.325
learn more

09:36.735 --> 09:37.860
and think more.

09:44.010 --> 09:45.010
My Lord,

09:45.435 --> 09:46.724
a guard from Xu Fengnian

09:46.960 --> 09:48.200
has sent a message at the gate.

09:48.325 --> 09:49.325
What is it?

09:49.985 --> 09:50.862
Xu Fengnian

09:50.886 --> 09:52.364
invited you to the inn.

09:53.260 --> 09:54.410
Tell him

09:55.335 --> 09:58.035
that I'm too busy reading scriptures
and practicing Buddhism

09:58.535 --> 10:00.285
to go out of home for the moment.

10:00.660 --> 10:01.660
Yes.

10:01.810 --> 10:02.810
Also,

10:02.835 --> 10:04.220
the guard who has sent the message

10:04.244 --> 10:05.925
is Third Graduate Lin.

10:06.610 --> 10:08.360
He isn't dead?

10:08.610 --> 10:09.610
Mm.

10:11.710 --> 10:13.661
I wondered
why the guard looked so familiar

10:13.685 --> 10:14.725
who used Chixia Swordplay.

10:20.410 --> 10:21.137
Father,

10:21.161 --> 10:22.336
they're deceiving His Majesty.

10:22.360 --> 10:24.781
His Majesty ordered
to exterminate the Lin family.

10:24.805 --> 10:26.565
We can deal with North Liang with it.

10:28.510 --> 10:30.525
Pretend we don't know this.

10:33.210 --> 10:35.610
See him out of our mansion.

10:36.585 --> 10:37.585
Yes.

10:44.510 --> 10:45.137
Father,

10:45.161 --> 10:47.061
even if we don't arrest Lin,

10:47.085 --> 10:49.100
you should at least check out
what Xu Fengnian will say.

10:49.124 --> 10:50.604
He represents North Liang, after all.

10:52.210 --> 10:53.142
If you don't go see Xu Fengnian,

10:53.166 --> 10:54.700
arrest Lin, first.

10:54.724 --> 10:55.964
Ignore him.

10:56.960 --> 10:59.445
Young Master of North Liang
is here in Xiangfan,

10:59.885 --> 11:01.135
but we're going to ignore him?

11:03.110 --> 11:04.445
Where's the student

11:04.810 --> 11:07.244
who offers advice to you?

11:07.635 --> 11:09.445
He said he would come and visit me.

11:11.310 --> 11:12.860
Sit and wait, then.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.960
Let's wait until he comes.

11:19.835 --> 11:20.712
At this moment,

11:20.736 --> 11:22.445
Xu Fengnian is more important.

11:23.135 --> 11:26.124
Why must you wait for a student
in Shangyin Academy?

11:54.035 --> 11:58.235
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an)

12:07.610 --> 12:11.185
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an)

12:14.585 --> 12:17.910
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an)

12:28.235 --> 12:31.761
(Mansion of Lord of Jing'an)

12:31.785 --> 12:33.165
I came by appointment,

12:33.460 --> 12:35.124
to relieve anxiety

12:35.310 --> 12:36.670
for His Lordship and His Highness.

12:47.160 --> 12:48.560
I didn't see Lord of Jing'an.

12:49.110 --> 12:51.210
I was told
that he was busy reading scriptures

12:51.335 --> 12:52.935
to come out of home for the moment.

12:54.735 --> 12:55.735
It doesn't matter.

12:55.835 --> 12:57.525
Let's just wait.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.535
Will we just live in Xiangfan like this

13:03.710 --> 13:05.285
until Lord of Jing'an comes to us?

13:06.935 --> 13:08.710
We can just visit the town.

13:09.810 --> 13:11.485
You're indeed not afraid of death.

13:11.735 --> 13:13.236
This is the lair of Lord of Jing'an.

13:13.260 --> 13:15.100
He can kill you
whenever and wherever possible.

13:16.160 --> 13:17.599
He won't kill me for the moment.

13:17.935 --> 13:19.484
Zhao Heng is cunning.

13:19.560 --> 13:20.925
He's waiting for news.

13:21.485 --> 13:22.585
What news?

13:22.985 --> 13:24.325
News from the capital.

13:24.735 --> 13:27.085
What does it have to do with you?

13:28.760 --> 13:29.760
Read it.

13:30.160 --> 13:31.885
Still one coin for a word?

13:31.960 --> 13:33.244
Always the fair price.

13:43.685 --> 13:46.205
Greetings, My Lord, Your Grace,

13:46.335 --> 13:47.335
and Your Highness.

13:47.560 --> 13:49.325
We've met once.

13:49.810 --> 13:50.925
Don't stand on ceremony.

13:51.485 --> 13:53.360
Let's just get to the point.

13:53.660 --> 13:54.964
Yes, My Lord.

13:55.760 --> 13:58.724
You want to kill Xu Fengnian by my hand?

13:59.360 --> 14:00.510
Let me correct it.

14:00.885 --> 14:02.160
I will help you

14:02.410 --> 14:03.644
to kill Xu Fengnian.

14:03.935 --> 14:05.724
Why must I kill him?

14:06.910 --> 14:08.285
I explained last time.

14:08.844 --> 14:11.165
If Xu Fengnian is killed,
Xu Xiao will rebel without doubt.

14:11.635 --> 14:12.761
Only when the world falls into chaos

14:12.785 --> 14:15.011
can you bring order out of chaos

14:15.035 --> 14:18.045
and take back the supreme throne.

14:23.385 --> 14:24.565
I know.

14:25.310 --> 14:27.364
Han Diaosi is your master.

14:29.460 --> 14:32.405
As the commander of eunuchs,

14:32.510 --> 14:34.010
he's proud and insolent.

14:34.260 --> 14:35.764
But he instructed you

14:36.635 --> 14:38.124
without reservation.

14:38.560 --> 14:40.781
He even gave you Fujiang Armor

14:40.805 --> 14:42.045
which was his shield.

14:42.635 --> 14:43.635
Why?

14:45.460 --> 14:46.835
I guess

14:48.160 --> 14:49.485
you know the answer.

14:53.360 --> 14:55.165
Because your family name is Zhao.

14:58.635 --> 15:01.310
Your mother died early.

15:02.325 --> 15:04.445
After that, Han Diaosi sent you

15:04.964 --> 15:06.325
to the capital.

15:06.925 --> 15:10.805
Then, he sent you to Shangyin Academy.

15:11.884 --> 15:15.964
The Academy always strictly investigates
the family background of students.

15:16.610 --> 15:17.884
You're the only exception.

15:19.460 --> 15:23.180
No one has asked who your father is.

15:23.885 --> 15:25.110
Who do you think

15:27.285 --> 15:29.010
my father is, My Lord?

15:35.205 --> 15:36.925
The Emperor.

15:45.885 --> 15:47.285
Speaking of it,

15:49.660 --> 15:51.525
you should call me Uncle.

15:52.685 --> 15:54.685
I'm not recorded
in the ancestral temple.

15:57.210 --> 15:58.560
I'm not

15:59.185 --> 16:00.205
one of the royal family.

16:03.560 --> 16:04.560
Right.

16:07.060 --> 16:08.835
If the world is in peace,

16:09.610 --> 16:12.644
you will never
be admitted to the capital.

16:14.205 --> 16:15.844
But once the world is in chaos,

16:16.085 --> 16:17.724
you'll have a chance.

16:18.585 --> 16:19.724
Zhao Kai,

16:21.660 --> 16:23.021
you don't want to kill Xu Fengnian

16:23.045 --> 16:24.086
for me,

16:25.285 --> 16:27.004
but for yourself.

16:28.235 --> 16:29.760
There're benefits for you and me.

16:31.585 --> 16:32.685
Like I said,

16:33.560 --> 16:35.000
only when the world falls into chaos

16:36.060 --> 16:37.560
can you return

16:38.360 --> 16:40.124
to the capital.

16:46.160 --> 16:47.160
Somebody!

16:56.010 --> 16:57.010
Take him

16:58.185 --> 16:59.860
to the dungeon.

17:01.585 --> 17:02.644
Wait.

17:05.235 --> 17:07.565
If someone from the martial world
kills Xu Fengnian,

17:08.135 --> 17:09.725
Xu Xiao will have no reason

17:10.260 --> 17:11.765
to blame you for that.

17:13.160 --> 17:15.685
I witnessed the masters
around Xu Fengnian.

17:16.325 --> 17:17.765
I've gathered martial artists

17:18.610 --> 17:19.965
who are able to kill him.

17:21.860 --> 17:23.204
I'm just waiting

17:24.525 --> 17:25.645
until you make up your mind.

17:38.185 --> 17:39.185
Father,

17:39.235 --> 17:40.404
he made sense.

17:40.585 --> 17:41.741
If the world is in chaos,

17:41.765 --> 17:42.765
you'll have a chance.

17:43.285 --> 17:46.045
We can't risk our lives

17:46.435 --> 17:47.765
simply for a small gain.

17:48.410 --> 17:50.005
It's not a small gain.

17:52.660 --> 17:55.565
We're not in a hurry to decide
whether we'll kill Xu Fengnian.

17:56.610 --> 17:58.560
Let's wait for the news.

18:00.435 --> 18:01.435
What news?

18:03.210 --> 18:04.810
Xu Xiao has been traveling at top speed.

18:05.725 --> 18:07.604
He's arriving in the capital soon.

18:09.760 --> 18:11.221
When he heads for the capital alone,

18:11.245 --> 18:12.285
isn't he seeking his doom?

18:13.685 --> 18:14.835
So,

18:15.060 --> 18:16.525
don't be impatient.

18:18.235 --> 18:20.710
If Xu Xiao is killed in the capital,

18:21.135 --> 18:22.860
we can kill Xu Fengnian

18:23.160 --> 18:25.210
to make perfection still more perfect.

18:25.935 --> 18:27.644
If Xu Xiao isn't killed,

18:28.710 --> 18:30.035
why do we bother

18:30.510 --> 18:32.364
sticking our necks out?

18:33.860 --> 18:36.385
The royal family treats Xu Xiao
as the one to cause chaos.

18:37.185 --> 18:38.411
Once he arrives in the capital,

18:38.435 --> 18:39.435
he will be killed.

18:39.860 --> 18:41.844
If he's sure to be killed,

18:43.860 --> 18:46.460
why is he rushing to the capital?

18:53.485 --> 18:54.710
Calm down

18:55.260 --> 18:56.635
and wait for the news.

19:07.060 --> 19:08.620
(Official Posthouse, Capital of Liyang)

20:10.010 --> 20:12.710
(Zhang Julu,
the prime minister of Liyang)

21:01.485 --> 21:02.765
Grand Commander,

21:04.085 --> 21:05.525
what a coincidence!

21:06.010 --> 21:07.310
Prime Minister Zhang.

21:10.435 --> 21:12.610
Long time no see.

21:13.735 --> 21:16.135
You came all the way to the capital.

21:16.510 --> 21:18.204
Why haven't you entered the town?

21:19.135 --> 21:21.085
I just saw the tree.

21:21.360 --> 21:22.600
It reminded me of the old days.

21:26.085 --> 21:27.460
How can the tree

21:28.960 --> 21:31.135
remind you of the old days?

21:32.810 --> 21:35.510
When my wife and I
came to the capital for the first time,

21:35.985 --> 21:37.965
we rested under the tree.

21:38.510 --> 21:39.565
We even made a mark

21:40.710 --> 21:41.924
on it.

21:42.860 --> 21:44.404
So,

21:44.735 --> 21:46.525
you're missing your wife?

21:47.785 --> 21:49.360
She's been dead.

21:49.910 --> 21:51.204
Luckily, the tree is still here.

21:51.810 --> 21:52.960
It's kind of

21:53.610 --> 21:54.684
a souvenir to me.

21:56.735 --> 21:57.844
Cut it down.

22:15.010 --> 22:18.185
It's such a precious tree.

22:18.385 --> 22:21.560
You'd better take it back to North Liang

22:21.710 --> 22:23.844
so that you can see it every day

22:26.485 --> 22:28.405
and miss your wife.

22:37.385 --> 22:39.185
Prime Minister,

22:39.835 --> 22:41.485
you travel with axes?

22:41.810 --> 22:43.565
I only take some axes today.

22:44.110 --> 22:45.884
Isn't it a coincidence?

22:46.610 --> 22:47.610
It is.

22:49.885 --> 22:51.160
It's quite a coincidence.

22:54.210 --> 22:55.210
Let's get into the town.

23:29.135 --> 23:30.245
Don't stop

23:30.985 --> 23:32.235
until you cut it down!

23:32.910 --> 23:39.785
(Zhang Julu provoked...)

23:41.710 --> 23:43.560
(Xu Xiao gave way.)

24:25.710 --> 24:26.710
I'm all right.

24:36.835 --> 24:38.535
This is Xu Xiao?

24:41.760 --> 24:43.311
News just came

24:43.335 --> 24:44.436
that outside the city gate,

24:44.460 --> 24:46.811
Prime Minister Zhang
prevailed over him.

24:46.835 --> 24:48.010
This is the capital,

24:48.034 --> 24:49.274
not North Liang.

24:51.185 --> 24:52.444
It's the imperial palace.

24:52.785 --> 24:54.485
I don't think he dare to be aggressive.

24:55.610 --> 24:56.610
Go.

25:00.360 --> 25:01.404
I'm Xu Xiao.

25:01.985 --> 25:03.364
I ask to meet His Majesty.

25:05.485 --> 25:07.635
Grand Commander,
please wait here for a moment.

25:35.660 --> 25:38.085
You came to the palace
with your blade and horse.

25:38.885 --> 25:40.844
How arrogant you are!

25:41.610 --> 25:42.965
In such an important place,

25:43.635 --> 25:45.360
you'd better behave yourself.

25:49.885 --> 25:51.535
Who are you?

25:54.385 --> 25:56.260
Grand Master for Splendid Happiness,

25:57.035 --> 25:58.761
(Liu Tiren, third-rank master of Liyang)
Liu Tiren.

25:58.785 --> 26:00.005
Oh, sub-third rank?

26:00.585 --> 26:02.011
The old system is adopted!

26:02.035 --> 26:03.725
The Grand Master
for Splendid Happiness

26:03.860 --> 26:05.164
is sort of the third rank!

26:06.635 --> 26:08.844
Oh, sort of?

26:09.310 --> 26:10.340
You're indeed powerful.

26:10.364 --> 26:11.364
Powerful.

26:12.010 --> 26:13.435
I'm not talking about power,

26:13.710 --> 26:15.660
but etiquette.

26:18.635 --> 26:19.260
Oh.

26:19.360 --> 26:20.360
Come on.

26:29.560 --> 26:32.210
It's not only about the robe.

26:32.310 --> 26:34.210
You shouldn't carry the blade, either.

26:45.085 --> 26:46.085
What's this?

26:46.560 --> 26:48.236
The python pattern, clearly.

26:48.260 --> 26:49.260
Python pattern?

26:49.785 --> 26:50.785
How many claws?

26:55.485 --> 26:56.485
Five claws?

26:57.085 --> 26:58.165
According to the etiquette,

26:58.335 --> 26:59.684
who dare

26:59.785 --> 27:01.560
to wear a five-claw robe?

27:03.685 --> 27:06.985
Relatives of the royal family.

27:07.885 --> 27:09.924
The blue robe is usually for lords

27:11.535 --> 27:13.160
with a different surname.

27:13.460 --> 27:14.711
Can a lord with a different surname

27:14.735 --> 27:16.924
carry a blade to the court?

27:20.310 --> 27:21.835
Bestowed by His Majesty,

27:22.835 --> 27:24.924
I can take the blade to the court.

27:26.035 --> 27:28.485
It's an imperial favor from His Majesty.

27:29.385 --> 27:31.045
As a third-rank official,

27:31.535 --> 27:33.005
you want me to take away my blade?

27:38.110 --> 27:39.485
Here it is.

27:40.260 --> 27:41.260
I...

27:42.285 --> 27:43.941
I was just reminding you.

27:43.965 --> 27:44.965
Reminding me?

27:46.035 --> 27:47.185
When a third-rank official

27:47.485 --> 27:48.485
meets a lord,

27:48.985 --> 27:50.385
should he kneel?

27:54.035 --> 27:55.610
You keep talking about etiquette,

27:56.045 --> 27:58.085
but you behave against it.

27:59.035 --> 28:00.911
Mr. Liu, you're having
greater authority

28:00.935 --> 28:03.805
than the favor from His Majesty.

28:03.910 --> 28:04.965
Ridiculous!

28:05.060 --> 28:06.385
Don't talk nonsense!

28:08.985 --> 28:10.825
How dare you beat me!

28:10.960 --> 28:12.110
I just want that.

28:15.285 --> 28:16.485
Somebody!

28:17.885 --> 28:18.885
Help!

28:21.035 --> 28:22.460
Somebody!

28:22.610 --> 28:24.360
Help!

28:51.935 --> 28:53.210
Liu Tiren.

28:54.085 --> 28:56.164
He fishes for fame.

28:56.485 --> 29:00.725
He wants to get an upright reputation
by using Xu Xiao.

29:01.460 --> 29:03.204
How sinister!

29:04.910 --> 29:06.684
Does he really think

29:07.185 --> 29:09.085
Xu Xiao is scared of me?

29:16.960 --> 29:19.485
Have a message sent to Qingzhou

29:19.835 --> 29:22.005
to Lord of Jing'an.

29:24.835 --> 29:27.045
We don't do something
because we're forced to,

29:28.485 --> 29:32.124
but because we want to.

29:51.910 --> 29:53.860
Help me!

30:03.510 --> 30:04.610
Do you know

30:04.835 --> 30:06.364
why I didn't make a fuss

30:06.635 --> 30:08.684
with Zhang Julu?

30:09.610 --> 30:11.161
Because he's the Prime Minister?

30:11.185 --> 30:13.085
It's not because of his position.

30:14.135 --> 30:15.245
Zhang Julu

30:15.935 --> 30:17.760
serves His Majesty,

30:18.135 --> 30:19.435
regardless of his own life.

30:19.785 --> 30:20.860
I have

30:20.884 --> 30:22.340
a little admiration for him

30:22.364 --> 30:23.364
more or less.

30:26.085 --> 30:27.444
As for you,

30:28.235 --> 30:30.285
you're simply asking for trouble.

30:30.535 --> 30:31.221
Come on.

30:31.245 --> 30:32.245
Let's continue.

30:32.635 --> 30:33.635
Come on.

30:34.885 --> 30:35.885
Grand Commander.

30:36.085 --> 30:37.085
Grand Commander.

30:37.285 --> 30:39.100
(Fengtian Hall)

30:39.124 --> 30:40.620
(Monk Yang Taisui)
Greeting, Grand Commander.

30:40.644 --> 30:41.644
Yang Taisui.

30:43.260 --> 30:44.436
Grand Commander,

30:44.460 --> 30:46.135
what are you doing?

30:46.660 --> 30:48.180
I was bored waiting.

30:48.204 --> 30:49.204
I just beat him for fun.

30:50.135 --> 30:52.444
Beating a third-rank official for fun?

30:53.560 --> 30:54.285
He...

30:54.485 --> 30:55.805
He was brave.

30:56.835 --> 30:58.005
Grand Commander,

30:59.085 --> 31:00.885
His Majesty is feeling unwell

31:00.985 --> 31:03.910
and he can't see you for the moment.

31:09.460 --> 31:10.460
Oh.

31:11.685 --> 31:12.685
You,

31:12.760 --> 31:14.164
walk me out.

31:16.035 --> 31:17.062
Come on.

31:18.885 --> 31:19.985
Yang Taisui.

31:22.085 --> 31:23.965
Look at you.

31:24.565 --> 31:26.325
I'm increasingly admiring you.

31:26.660 --> 31:29.860
Kings and bears
often worry their keepers.

31:29.884 --> 31:31.965
But you've kept His Majesty company
for decades.

31:32.385 --> 31:35.061
If you live
for another twenty or thirty years,

31:35.085 --> 31:37.541
you will have served three dynasties.

31:37.565 --> 31:40.765
Then you'll be the real Grand Abbot.

31:41.785 --> 31:43.741
I'm an ordinary monk

31:43.765 --> 31:45.525
without an official position.

31:45.960 --> 31:46.960
Monk?

31:47.510 --> 31:49.565
There's no ordinary monk like you.

31:53.110 --> 31:54.245
Think about it.

31:54.485 --> 31:56.204
How long has it been since we last met?

31:56.935 --> 31:57.935
Yeah.

31:58.210 --> 32:01.035
It's been many years
since you came to the capital last time.

32:02.210 --> 32:03.364
I'm getting old

32:03.635 --> 32:04.965
and I'm getting more cowardly.

32:05.935 --> 32:07.586
You? Cowardly?

32:07.610 --> 32:08.610
Mm.

32:08.660 --> 32:10.910
You beat a third-rank official
in front of Fengtian Hall.

32:11.210 --> 32:12.860
If you were cowardly,

32:12.884 --> 32:13.935
no one in this world

32:14.210 --> 32:16.260
could be bold.

32:17.485 --> 32:18.485
By the way,

32:19.235 --> 32:20.725
is His Majesty

32:22.035 --> 32:23.340
really sick

32:23.364 --> 32:25.485
or does he not want to see me?

32:26.485 --> 32:28.364
Don't you know?

32:31.360 --> 32:32.565
Tell me.

32:33.128 --> 32:33.855
Well,

32:33.879 --> 32:35.820
how long do I have to wait

32:35.844 --> 32:37.005
before he wants to see me?

32:38.785 --> 32:40.604
It depends on

32:40.835 --> 32:42.644
how your son leaves Qingzhou.

32:47.510 --> 32:49.285
You old pal.

32:50.085 --> 32:51.364
You told me the truth!

32:52.610 --> 32:53.287
So,

32:53.311 --> 32:54.701
among millions of people in the capital,

32:54.725 --> 32:56.164
you're my only friend.

32:58.560 --> 33:00.836
I can be your friend

33:00.860 --> 33:02.565
as long as you don't touch my head.

33:03.410 --> 33:04.410
Right.

33:04.710 --> 33:06.160
It's said

33:06.235 --> 33:08.635
that two things can't be touched.

33:08.760 --> 33:10.380
The buttocks of a tiger

33:10.404 --> 33:11.461
as well as

33:11.485 --> 33:13.710
your head.

33:14.560 --> 33:15.541
Here it goes again.

33:15.565 --> 33:16.380
Go, go, go.

33:16.404 --> 33:17.011
Let's go play chess.

33:17.035 --> 33:18.035
Go.

33:21.460 --> 33:26.185
(Zhang Julu provoked
outside the capital. Xu Xiao gave way.)

33:37.510 --> 33:39.644
Zhang Julu provoked outside the capital.

33:40.010 --> 33:41.884
Xu Xiao gave way.

33:42.510 --> 33:44.684
Prime Minister Zhang...

33:45.035 --> 33:46.485
Everybody knows

33:46.660 --> 33:48.005
that he's very ambitious.

33:48.985 --> 33:50.985
What he wants to do most

33:51.560 --> 33:53.164
is to dethrone the lords.

33:54.885 --> 33:55.885
How dare he!

33:57.285 --> 34:00.325
Royal clans like us
are not his first target.

34:01.935 --> 34:04.444
North Liang is the first

34:05.360 --> 34:06.685
he wants to handle.

34:07.760 --> 34:08.760
Xu Xiao?

34:10.035 --> 34:12.124
Zhang Julu provoked Xu Xiao
outside the capital,

34:12.710 --> 34:14.485
to force Xu Xiao to fight him.

34:16.210 --> 34:19.385
Once Xu Xiao kills the Prime Minister,

34:20.535 --> 34:22.045
His Majesty has no choice,

34:22.710 --> 34:23.860
but to execute him.

34:25.485 --> 34:27.485
Doesn't Zhang Julu care
for his own life?

34:28.760 --> 34:30.710
He will risk his life for fame.

34:31.435 --> 34:33.324
That's what intellectuals do, isn't it?

34:35.385 --> 34:36.585
However,

34:37.005 --> 34:38.284
even though

34:38.560 --> 34:40.244
Zhang Julu has
different political views,

34:40.835 --> 34:43.925
Xu Xiao and I

34:44.310 --> 34:46.244
kind of admire him.

34:47.760 --> 34:49.985
Xu Xiao has been in the capital.

34:51.610 --> 34:53.130
Why hasn't His Majesty killed him yet?

34:53.335 --> 34:54.335
His Majesty?

34:56.785 --> 34:58.285
My second eldest brother...

34:58.435 --> 34:59.684
He's far-sighted.

35:01.185 --> 35:03.011
If Xu Xiao dies in the capital,

35:03.035 --> 35:04.365
North Liang Army will rebel.

35:05.510 --> 35:09.124
He wants Xu Xiao to die of old age

35:09.510 --> 35:12.644
so that the playboy Xu Fengnian
will take the throne.

35:12.960 --> 35:14.740
When there's civil strife
in North Liang,

35:14.764 --> 35:16.644
he'll draw some generals over
and drive a wedge.

35:17.660 --> 35:19.420
He doesn't need
to send even a single soldier

35:19.860 --> 35:22.235
before North Liang breaks down.

35:22.860 --> 35:25.965
So, His Majesty disagrees
with Zhang Julu?

35:27.860 --> 35:31.124
Yes, or why would Zhang Julu

35:31.960 --> 35:33.580
provoke Xu Xiao outside the capital

35:33.604 --> 35:35.604
when he was always calm?

35:37.685 --> 35:38.810
He did that

35:39.435 --> 35:42.604
to drive Xu Xiao into the impasse.

35:43.410 --> 35:44.410
No wonder

35:44.785 --> 35:46.065
Xu Xiao didn't fight Zhang Julu.

35:48.060 --> 35:50.604
Xu Xiao is quite crafty.

35:51.485 --> 35:53.485
He won't easily be tricked.

35:55.735 --> 35:58.735
Xu Xiao arrived in the capital
a couple of days ago.

35:59.310 --> 36:01.230
Why does His Majesty
still refuse to see him yet?

36:01.835 --> 36:04.005
He's waiting for our action.

36:05.885 --> 36:07.005
Our action?

36:17.385 --> 36:18.635
This is a message

36:19.310 --> 36:20.405
from Zhang Julu.

36:20.560 --> 36:23.045
We don't do something
because we're forced to,

36:23.124 --> 36:25.385
but because we want to.

36:27.660 --> 36:28.885
What does it mean?

36:30.110 --> 36:31.565
There are five kinds of rites.

36:32.210 --> 36:33.890
The sacrificial rite
is the most important.

36:35.560 --> 36:36.724
We offer the sacrificial rite

36:37.635 --> 36:40.204
not because we're forced to,

36:40.535 --> 36:42.965
but because we want to.

36:43.985 --> 36:45.445
It's about the sacrificial rite.

36:47.760 --> 36:50.535
Not because we're forced to,
but because we want to.

36:51.510 --> 36:53.445
Zhang Julu is reminding me

36:54.735 --> 36:57.604
that we shouldn't take action forcibly,

36:57.885 --> 37:00.385
but spontaneously.

37:02.285 --> 37:03.710
What action?

37:05.910 --> 37:07.635
He's urging me

37:08.085 --> 37:10.810
to kill Xu Fengnian spontaneously.

37:11.260 --> 37:12.260
What?

37:14.210 --> 37:16.310
His Majesty doesn't meet Xu Xiao,

37:17.585 --> 37:19.485
because he's waiting to see

37:19.885 --> 37:21.804
what Xu Fengnian will suffer
in our place.

37:25.910 --> 37:28.085
North Liang and we

37:29.160 --> 37:30.760
have been at a stalemate
for a long time.

37:31.660 --> 37:32.700
If Xu Fengnian

37:32.724 --> 37:34.724
leaves Xiangfan so easily,

37:35.785 --> 37:39.260
His Majesty will suspect

37:39.284 --> 37:42.005
that we've joined hands
with North Liang secretly.

37:44.035 --> 37:45.835
If we kill Xu Fengnian,

37:45.985 --> 37:47.724
His Majesty will be relieved.

37:49.604 --> 37:50.884
We offer the sacrificial rite...

37:51.810 --> 37:52.810
The sacrificial

37:54.310 --> 37:56.485
refers to the death of Xu Fengnian.

37:58.935 --> 38:00.035
So,

38:00.285 --> 38:02.164
Zhang Julu made sense.

38:03.085 --> 38:04.764
Shall we kill Xu Fengnian?

38:07.385 --> 38:08.941
If we kill Xu Fengnian,

38:08.965 --> 38:10.285
North Liang will certainly rebel.

38:11.785 --> 38:13.780
By then, His Majesty is very likely

38:13.804 --> 38:15.485
to apologize to Xu Xiao

38:16.160 --> 38:18.324
with my life.

38:20.485 --> 38:21.736
Prime Minister Zhang

38:21.760 --> 38:23.136
has got a good plan.

38:23.160 --> 38:25.260
He wants me to kill Xu Fengnian.

38:26.535 --> 38:29.660
When Qingzhou and North Liang
are both destroyed,

38:30.335 --> 38:32.405
his plan to dethrone lords

38:33.260 --> 38:35.164
will proceed without hindrance.

38:35.810 --> 38:38.405
Zhang Julu is quite vicious.

38:38.885 --> 38:40.785
Doesn't he fear he'll be involved?

38:41.435 --> 38:42.785
He just sent us a message

38:43.385 --> 38:45.204
without a distinct saying.

38:47.085 --> 38:49.405
He won't be involved.

38:51.485 --> 38:52.845
What a man!

38:53.710 --> 38:55.150
We're stuck in a dilemma, aren't we?

38:55.385 --> 38:56.821
We should neither kill Xu Fengnian
nor keep him alive.

38:56.845 --> 38:58.005
What do we do?

39:02.410 --> 39:03.635
Now that

39:04.960 --> 39:06.080
all parties are watching me,

39:08.260 --> 39:09.804
let me do something.

39:11.585 --> 39:12.585
Get the carriage ready.

39:13.585 --> 39:14.804
My wife and I

39:15.435 --> 39:17.045
are going to meet Xu Fengnian.

39:21.060 --> 39:22.060
She's going, too?

39:27.085 --> 39:29.710
(Solitary Central Plains)

39:42.335 --> 39:47.510
(Yuelai Inn)

40:04.010 --> 40:05.010
What's wrong?

40:06.185 --> 40:07.185
Someone unkind has come.

40:07.360 --> 40:08.525
He's waiting in the backyard.

40:08.965 --> 40:10.045
Go tell His Highness.

40:22.935 --> 40:24.845
Miss Chudong, why did you come alone?

40:25.610 --> 40:26.610
Where's Uncle Wang?

40:31.985 --> 40:34.510
Your Highness, you've got
enough beautiful girls.

40:35.110 --> 40:36.390
I'm not good enough for you.

40:36.685 --> 40:38.005
Please let me go.

40:38.435 --> 40:39.435
What?

40:41.160 --> 40:42.261
You want her?

40:42.285 --> 40:42.862
No.

40:42.886 --> 40:44.284
It's none of my business.

40:45.235 --> 40:46.485
My father said so, too.

40:46.735 --> 40:47.735
You don't believe me?

40:48.285 --> 40:49.835
If you were me, would you believe it?

40:50.610 --> 40:52.244
If you hadn't asked for me,

40:52.385 --> 40:53.580
why would my father
had made me leave with you

40:53.604 --> 40:54.685
after he met you once?

40:59.210 --> 41:00.300
Lord of Jing'an has arrived.

41:00.324 --> 41:01.885
He's waiting for you in the back room.

41:02.560 --> 41:03.565
At last.

41:04.535 --> 41:05.365
Did he come alone?

41:05.510 --> 41:07.111
He came with his wife
and his son Zhao Xun.

41:07.135 --> 41:08.510
A lot of guards, as well.

41:10.810 --> 41:11.810
All right.

41:14.035 --> 41:15.311
I'll be right back.

41:15.335 --> 41:16.061
Don't worry.

41:16.085 --> 41:16.982
When I'm back,

41:17.006 --> 41:18.644
I'll explain to you.

41:21.185 --> 41:22.635
I'll be waiting here.

41:24.035 --> 41:26.135
I hear Lord of Jing'an
loves his wife most.

41:28.310 --> 41:29.365
Does it bother you?

41:29.735 --> 41:30.735
It's very important.

41:33.335 --> 41:34.335
Exactly.

41:34.535 --> 41:35.925
Everyone in Qingzhou knows

41:36.060 --> 41:38.785
Lord of Jing'an treats
Consort Pei Nanwei as a treasure.

41:39.610 --> 41:40.965
Everybody in Qingzhou knows that?

41:41.135 --> 41:42.535
Yes, everybody.

41:44.585 --> 41:46.065
Pei Nanwei is his second wife, right?

41:46.535 --> 41:48.045
His first wife died many years ago.

41:48.235 --> 41:50.285
Now, Pei Nanwei is his consort.

41:53.410 --> 41:54.525
I see.

41:55.185 --> 41:56.185
Hey.

41:57.885 --> 41:59.760
Would you like to go
and meet Lord of Jing'an?

42:00.365 --> 42:01.635
What's the fun of that?

42:02.085 --> 42:02.862
When I don't need to read,

42:02.886 --> 42:04.385
I would rather go out for a stroll.

42:06.160 --> 42:07.160
Let's go.

42:39.235 --> 42:41.115
His Lordship is expecting
Young Master Fengnian.

42:41.235 --> 42:42.910
Irrelevant persons should stay away.

42:49.685 --> 42:50.410
Wait.

42:50.610 --> 42:51.611
Why are you closing the door?

42:51.635 --> 42:52.635
Ning Emei,

42:53.660 --> 42:54.860
don't be rude.

43:29.865 --> 43:32.585
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.360 --> 43:37.160
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.085 --> 43:42.005
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.085 --> 43:46.885
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.185 --> 43:51.085
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.785 --> 43:55.605
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.610 --> 44:00.365
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.385 --> 44:05.310
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.810 --> 44:08.541
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.565 --> 44:09.805
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.585 --> 44:14.445
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.260 --> 44:17.986
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.010 --> 44:19.445
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.935 --> 44:23.810
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.235 --> 44:25.586
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.610 --> 44:28.445
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.860 --> 44:31.341
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.365 --> 44:33.765
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.060 --> 44:36.086
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.110 --> 44:38.286
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.310 --> 44:42.525
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.885 --> 44:44.021
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.045 --> 44:47.085
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.260 --> 44:49.221
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.245 --> 44:51.965
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.525 --> 44:54.341
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.365 --> 44:56.861
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.885 --> 45:01.185
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
